**/android/.gradle
**/android/captures/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/local.properties
**/android/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
**/android/app/src/main/java/io/flutter/plugins/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
**/android/.cxx/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/app/crashlytics-build.properties

